<title>ESTONIA: TRADE IN KALEV EX-RIGHTS FROM JULY 8.</title>
<headline>TRADE IN KALEV EX-RIGHTS FROM JULY 8.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade in Kalev confectionary shares from July 8 will be ex-rights for dividend payments and participation in its share issue, the stock exchange said on Monday.</p>
<p>Kalev will fix the list of shareholders to receive dividend payments and to participate in the company's share issue on July 11, the Tallinn stock exchange said in a statement.</p>
<p>Kalev will pay a 22 kroons dividend per share and will issue 22 shares for every share held.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9202/1 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
